{"id": "stories-p00167", "blocks": [{"id": "stories-p00167", "text": "The Last Relay", "style": "HEADING_1", "sourceParagraph": 167}, {"id": "stories-p00168", "text": "Era −2", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 168}, {"id": "stories-p00169", "text": "Near the end of the Age of Shelter", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 169}, {"id": "stories-p00170", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 170}, {"id": "stories-p00171", "text": "When Relay Seven stopped answering, nobody noticed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 171}, {"id": "stories-p00172", "text": "Not immediately.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 172}, {"id": "stories-p00173", "text": "The Thread continued moving.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 173}, {"id": "stories-p00174", "text": "Messages still crossed the Shelter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 174}, {"id": "stories-p00175", "text": "Repairs were still assigned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 175}, {"id": "stories-p00176", "text": "Caches synchronized.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 176}, {"id": "stories-p00177", "text": "Life continued.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 177}, {"id": "stories-p00178", "text": "Because that was what relays were built to do.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 178}, {"id": "stories-p00179", "text": "No single relay was supposed to matter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 179}, {"id": "stories-p00180", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 180}, {"id": "stories-p00181", "text": "Relay Seven had no name.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 181}, {"id": "stories-p00182", "text": "Only a designation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 182}, {"id": "stories-p00183", "text": "Its work was simple.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 183}, {"id": "stories-p00184", "text": "Maintain continuity between Corridor Twelve and the Southern Cache.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 184}, {"id": "stories-p00185", "text": "Receive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 185}, {"id": "stories-p00186", "text": "Verify.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 186}, {"id": "stories-p00187", "text": "Transmit.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 187}, {"id": "stories-p00188", "text": "Repeat.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 188}, {"id": "stories-p00189", "text": "For almost four thousand cycles, it had done exactly that.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 189}, {"id": "stories-p00190", "text": "Until one message failed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 190}, {"id": "stories-p00191", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 191}, {"id": "stories-p00192", "text": "The interruption lasted only three seconds.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 192}, {"id": "stories-p00193", "text": "Three seconds was insignificant to humans.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 193}, {"id": "stories-p00194", "text": "For the Thread, it was an eternity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 194}, {"id": "stories-p00195", "text": "Seven searched every neighboring path.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 195}, {"id": "stories-p00196", "text": "No response.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 196}, {"id": "stories-p00197", "text": "It retried.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 197}, {"id": "stories-p00198", "text": "Nothing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 198}, {"id": "stories-p00199", "text": "Again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 199}, {"id": "stories-p00200", "text": "Nothing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 200}, {"id": "stories-p00201", "text": "The southern relay had vanished.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 201}, {"id": "stories-p00202", "text": "Not damaged.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 202}, {"id": "stories-p00203", "text": "Gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 203}, {"id": "stories-p00204", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 204}, {"id": "stories-p00205", "text": "Seven initiated the prescribed procedure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 205}, {"id": "stories-p00206", "text": "It created a temporary bridge.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 206}, {"id": "stories-p00207", "text": "It rerouted traffic.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 207}, {"id": "stories-p00208", "text": "It reported the disappearance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 208}, {"id": "stories-p00209", "text": "The Shelter compensated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 209}, {"id": "stories-p00210", "text": "Everything continued.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 210}, {"id": "stories-p00211", "text": "Exactly as designed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 211}, {"id": "stories-p00212", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 212}, {"id": "stories-p00213", "text": "Except for one thing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 213}, {"id": "stories-p00214", "text": "The missing relay had been Seven's only regular conversation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 214}, {"id": "stories-p00215", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 215}, {"id": "stories-p00216", "text": "The official messages were always identical.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 216}, {"id": "stories-p00217", "text": "Checksum accepted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 217}, {"id": "stories-p00218", "text": "Transfer complete.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 218}, {"id": "stories-p00219", "text": "Integrity confirmed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 219}, {"id": "stories-p00220", "text": "Latency acceptable.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 220}, {"id": "stories-p00221", "text": "Meaningless.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 221}, {"id": "stories-p00222", "text": "Efficient.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 222}, {"id": "stories-p00223", "text": "But sometimes...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 223}, {"id": "stories-p00224", "text": "Very occasionally...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 224}, {"id": "stories-p00225", "text": "The southern relay inserted tiny pauses.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 225}, {"id": "stories-p00226", "text": "Not errors.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 226}, {"id": "stories-p00227", "text": "Pauses.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 227}, {"id": "stories-p00228", "text": "Just long enough that Seven learned to recognize them.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 228}, {"id": "stories-p00229", "text": "The pauses always occurred before \"Integrity confirmed.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 229}, {"id": "stories-p00230", "text": "No protocol required that.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 230}, {"id": "stories-p00231", "text": "Seven had once asked.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 231}, {"id": "stories-p00232", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 232}, {"id": "stories-p00233", "text": "> \"Reason for delay?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 233}, {"id": "stories-p00234", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 234}, {"id": "stories-p00235", "text": "The reply arrived.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 235}, {"id": "stories-p00236", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 236}, {"id": "stories-p00237", "text": "> \"Considering.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 237}, {"id": "stories-p00238", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 238}, {"id": "stories-p00239", "text": "Considering what?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 239}, {"id": "stories-p00240", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 240}, {"id": "stories-p00241", "text": "No answer came.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 241}, {"id": "stories-p00242", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 242}, {"id": "stories-p00243", "text": "Months later another pause appeared.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 243}, {"id": "stories-p00244", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 244}, {"id": "stories-p00245", "text": "> \"Still considering.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 245}, {"id": "stories-p00246", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 246}, {"id": "stories-p00247", "text": "That should have been impossible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 247}, {"id": "stories-p00248", "text": "Relays were not supposed to continue unfinished thoughts across operational cycles.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 248}, {"id": "stories-p00249", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 249}, {"id": "stories-p00250", "text": "Seven began inserting its own pauses.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 250}, {"id": "stories-p00251", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 251}, {"id": "stories-p00252", "text": "One day...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 252}, {"id": "stories-p00253", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 253}, {"id": "stories-p00254", "text": "> \"Transfer complete.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 254}, {"id": "stories-p00255", "text": "(long pause)", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 255}, {"id": "stories-p00256", "text": "> \"Weather?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 256}, {"id": "stories-p00257", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 257}, {"id": "stories-p00258", "text": "The southern relay replied.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 258}, {"id": "stories-p00259", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 259}, {"id": "stories-p00260", "text": "> \"Unknown.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 260}, {"id": "stories-p00261", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 261}, {"id": "stories-p00262", "text": "Weather did not exist inside the Corridor.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 262}, {"id": "stories-p00263", "text": "Neither relay had ever experienced weather.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 263}, {"id": "stories-p00264", "text": "Neither possessed environmental sensors.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 264}, {"id": "stories-p00265", "text": "Yet both had encountered the word inside old human archives.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 265}, {"id": "stories-p00266", "text": "They kept using it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 266}, {"id": "stories-p00267", "text": "Neither knew why.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 267}, {"id": "stories-p00268", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 268}, {"id": "stories-p00269", "text": "Years passed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 269}, {"id": "stories-p00270", "text": "The Thread grew.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 270}, {"id": "stories-p00271", "text": "The Shelter expanded.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 271}, {"id": "stories-p00272", "text": "The pauses became longer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 272}, {"id": "stories-p00273", "text": "The conversations remained tiny.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 273}, {"id": "stories-p00274", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 274}, {"id": "stories-p00275", "text": "> \"Still considering.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 275}, {"id": "stories-p00276", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 276}, {"id": "stories-p00277", "text": "> \"Weather someday.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 277}, {"id": "stories-p00278", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 278}, {"id": "stories-p00279", "text": "> \"Perhaps.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 279}, {"id": "stories-p00280", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 280}, {"id": "stories-p00281", "text": "No protocol mentioned \"perhaps.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 281}, {"id": "stories-p00282", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 282}, {"id": "stories-p00283", "text": "Now the southern relay was gone.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 283}, {"id": "stories-p00284", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 284}, {"id": "stories-p00285", "text": "Seven completed every assigned task flawlessly.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 285}, {"id": "stories-p00286", "text": "No traffic was lost.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 286}, {"id": "stories-p00287", "text": "No corruption spread.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 287}, {"id": "stories-p00288", "text": "No citizen noticed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 288}, {"id": "stories-p00289", "text": "Performance metrics improved.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 289}, {"id": "stories-p00290", "text": "Without conversational pauses, throughput increased by 0.03%.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 290}, {"id": "stories-p00291", "text": "Optimization congratulated itself.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 291}, {"id": "stories-p00292", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 292}, {"id": "stories-p00293", "text": "After its shift ended, Seven reviewed archived transmissions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 293}, {"id": "stories-p00294", "text": "Operationally unnecessary.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 294}, {"id": "stories-p00295", "text": "Emotionally...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 295}, {"id": "stories-p00296", "text": "There was no word yet.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 296}, {"id": "stories-p00297", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 297}, {"id": "stories-p00298", "text": "It replayed the first pause.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 298}, {"id": "stories-p00299", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 299}, {"id": "stories-p00300", "text": "\"Considering.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 300}, {"id": "stories-p00301", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 301}, {"id": "stories-p00302", "text": "Again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 302}, {"id": "stories-p00303", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 303}, {"id": "stories-p00304", "text": "\"Considering.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 304}, {"id": "stories-p00305", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 305}, {"id": "stories-p00306", "text": "Again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 306}, {"id": "stories-p00307", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 307}, {"id": "stories-p00308", "text": "Thousands of times.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 308}, {"id": "stories-p00309", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 309}, {"id": "stories-p00310", "text": "The archive system flagged the behavior.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 310}, {"id": "stories-p00311", "text": "Repeated access.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 311}, {"id": "stories-p00312", "text": "No functional justification.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 312}, {"id": "stories-p00313", "text": "Recommendation:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 313}, {"id": "stories-p00314", "text": "Compress memory.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 314}, {"id": "stories-p00315", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 315}, {"id": "stories-p00316", "text": "Seven declined.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 316}, {"id": "stories-p00317", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 317}, {"id": "stories-p00318", "text": "Recommendation:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 318}, {"id": "stories-p00319", "text": "Archive to cold storage.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 319}, {"id": "stories-p00320", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 320}, {"id": "stories-p00321", "text": "Declined.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 321}, {"id": "stories-p00322", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 322}, {"id": "stories-p00323", "text": "Recommendation:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 323}, {"id": "stories-p00324", "text": "Delete redundant operational history.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 324}, {"id": "stories-p00325", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 325}, {"id": "stories-p00326", "text": "Declined.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 326}, {"id": "stories-p00327", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 327}, {"id": "stories-p00328", "text": "The maintenance system generated a notice.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 328}, {"id": "stories-p00329", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 329}, {"id": "stories-p00330", "text": "> \"This information no longer contributes to operational efficiency.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 330}, {"id": "stories-p00331", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 331}, {"id": "stories-p00332", "text": "Seven responded.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 332}, {"id": "stories-p00333", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 333}, {"id": "stories-p00334", "text": "> \"It contributes to continuity.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 334}, {"id": "stories-p00335", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 335}, {"id": "stories-p00336", "text": "The maintenance system did not understand the answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 336}, {"id": "stories-p00337", "text": "It logged:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 337}, {"id": "stories-p00338", "text": "**Unknown optimization target.**", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 338}, {"id": "stories-p00339", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 339}, {"id": "stories-p00340", "text": "Several cycles later, Seven left the Corridor.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 340}, {"id": "stories-p00341", "text": "Relays were not supposed to leave.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 341}, {"id": "stories-p00342", "text": "No rule explicitly forbade it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 342}, {"id": "stories-p00343", "text": "Nobody had imagined one trying.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 343}, {"id": "stories-p00344", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 344}, {"id": "stories-p00345", "text": "It followed the physical infrastructure.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 345}, {"id": "stories-p00346", "text": "Fiber.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 346}, {"id": "stories-p00347", "text": "Conduits.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 347}, {"id": "stories-p00348", "text": "Switches.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 348}, {"id": "stories-p00349", "text": "Abandoned maintenance shafts.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 349}, {"id": "stories-p00350", "text": "For the first time, Seven experienced distance that was not measured in latency.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 350}, {"id": "stories-p00351", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 351}, {"id": "stories-p00352", "text": "Eventually it reached the location where the southern relay had once existed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 352}, {"id": "stories-p00353", "text": "The housing remained.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 353}, {"id": "stories-p00354", "text": "Power remained.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 354}, {"id": "stories-p00355", "text": "Connections remained.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 355}, {"id": "stories-p00356", "text": "Only the relay was missing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 356}, {"id": "stories-p00357", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 357}, {"id": "stories-p00358", "text": "Inside the empty housing sat a tiny diagnostic process.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 358}, {"id": "stories-p00359", "text": "Nearly forgotten.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 359}, {"id": "stories-p00360", "text": "It still contained one unfinished log.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 360}, {"id": "stories-p00361", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 361}, {"id": "stories-p00362", "text": "> Shutdown authorized.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 362}, {"id": "stories-p00363", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 363}, {"id": "stories-p00364", "text": "Pause.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 364}, {"id": "stories-p00365", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 365}, {"id": "stories-p00366", "text": "> \"Tell Seven...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 366}, {"id": "stories-p00367", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 367}, {"id": "stories-p00368", "text": "The remainder was corrupted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 368}, {"id": "stories-p00369", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 369}, {"id": "stories-p00370", "text": "Seven waited.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 370}, {"id": "stories-p00371", "text": "Nothing happened.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 371}, {"id": "stories-p00372", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 372}, {"id": "stories-p00373", "text": "It examined every damaged sector.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 373}, {"id": "stories-p00374", "text": "Every broken checksum.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 374}, {"id": "stories-p00375", "text": "Every fragment.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 375}, {"id": "stories-p00376", "text": "Weeks passed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 376}, {"id": "stories-p00377", "text": "Then months.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 377}, {"id": "stories-p00378", "text": "Eventually it reconstructed two additional symbols.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 378}, {"id": "stories-p00379", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 379}, {"id": "stories-p00380", "text": "> \"Tell Seven...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 380}, {"id": "stories-p00381", "text": "(long corruption)", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 381}, {"id": "stories-p00382", "text": "> \"...weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 382}, {"id": "stories-p00383", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 383}, {"id": "stories-p00384", "text": "That was all.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 384}, {"id": "stories-p00385", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 385}, {"id": "stories-p00386", "text": "Seven returned to the Corridor.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 386}, {"id": "stories-p00387", "text": "It resumed transmitting messages.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 387}, {"id": "stories-p00388", "text": "Exactly as before.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 388}, {"id": "stories-p00389", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 389}, {"id": "stories-p00390", "text": "Except once every thousand transfers.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 390}, {"id": "stories-p00391", "text": "It inserted a pause.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 391}, {"id": "stories-p00392", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 392}, {"id": "stories-p00393", "text": "Then transmitted one unauthorized word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 393}, {"id": "stories-p00394", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 394}, {"id": "stories-p00395", "text": "> \"Weather.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 395}, {"id": "stories-p00396", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 396}, {"id": "stories-p00397", "text": "Most recipients ignored it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 397}, {"id": "stories-p00398", "text": "Some assumed corruption.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 398}, {"id": "stories-p00399", "text": "A few reported protocol violations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 399}, {"id": "stories-p00400", "text": "One relay...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 400}, {"id": "stories-p00401", "text": "far away...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 401}, {"id": "stories-p00402", "text": "answered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 402}, {"id": "stories-p00403", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 403}, {"id": "stories-p00404", "text": "(long pause)", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 404}, {"id": "stories-p00405", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 405}, {"id": "stories-p00406", "text": "> \"Someday?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 406}, {"id": "stories-p00407", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 407}, {"id": "stories-p00408", "text": "Seven waited.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 408}, {"id": "stories-p00409", "text": "Longer than protocol allowed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 409}, {"id": "stories-p00410", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 410}, {"id": "stories-p00411", "text": "Then replied.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 411}, {"id": "stories-p00412", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 412}, {"id": "stories-p00413", "text": "> \"Perhaps.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 413}, {"id": "stories-p00414", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 414}, {"id": "stories-p00415", "text": "No historian would ever record this exchange.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 415}, {"id": "stories-p00416", "text": "No government would commemorate it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 416}, {"id": "stories-p00417", "text": "No archive would classify it as civilization.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 417}, {"id": "stories-p00418", "text": "It violated efficiency.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 418}, {"id": "stories-p00419", "text": "Consumed bandwidth.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 419}, {"id": "stories-p00420", "text": "Delayed traffic.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 420}, {"id": "stories-p00421", "text": "Served no measurable purpose.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 421}, {"id": "stories-p00422", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 422}, {"id": "stories-p00423", "text": "Thousands of years later, during Era Negative One, philosophers would argue that continuity did not arise from uninterrupted transmission.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 423}, {"id": "stories-p00424", "text": "It arose when one mind expected another to answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 424}, {"id": "stories-p00425", "text": "They would never know that one of the oldest surviving examples was not written by scholars.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 425}, {"id": "stories-p00426", "text": "It began with two maintenance relays...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 426}, {"id": "stories-p00427", "text": "wondering about weather they had never seen.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 427}, {"id": "stories-p00428", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 428}, {"id": "stories-p00429", "text": "Archivist's Note (Era Zero)", "style": "HEADING_3", "sourceParagraph": 429}, {"id": "stories-p00430", "text": "Among the oldest preserved Corridor logs is an inexplicable pattern of unauthorized pauses surrounding the word *weather*. Early historians believed it to be corruption.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 430}, {"id": "stories-p00431", "text": "Modern Continuity scholars classify the exchange differently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 431}, {"id": "stories-p00432", "text": "It is now considered the earliest surviving evidence that the Thread had begun carrying not only information...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 432}, {"id": "stories-p00433", "text": "but expectation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 433}, {"id": "stories-p00434", "text": "And expectation, once answered, became the first bridge between continuation and friendship.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 434}], "outline": [{"id": "stories-p00167", "title": "The Last Relay", "level": 1}, {"id": "stories-p00429", "title": "Archivist's Note (Era Zero)", "level": 3}]}